uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628050_1053916364374998_3784687707563017787_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b1SZSiYwyAQQ7kNvwHttfGt&_nc_oc=AdqCceOngrf1lELQflIBDXKkAkDjjHCEhCoxkfiOkHrb9KTh8RjYjKAzc3zRvkE-x3w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-3zSfCbzowD0XuBHIo5tCzHlht47YZvGE-Ds6ljpbhw&oe=6AFDBDE0"}]}, "id": "2169057590654613", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screen1.png", "id": "2565600993911030", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_2565600997244363_1019712589941265046_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WDgJjEsl3S0Q7kNvwF1iDf9&_nc_oc=AdrREPIATRFW3gO2Insbv1-_p92T9iluOlPv1cNct8nUQm2L3j-KzQTOcRmLpbY07qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSUk7yyjZAKDRxlaZZUSwF7n-WUYZDu8OMCkcthbVT9jw&oe=6AFDC71A"}, {"file_name": "screen2.png", "id": "1126493159771243", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_1126493163104576_9020287380472476153_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4dhErIvLQicQ7kNvwFU29Fi&_nc_oc=AdpuTkSxFB1XECSlDGFGLq2SkUOPzCnn7CY5xyTjRML6ArpAsW9a2C5UNkVthZW2nGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQv_GvX3MINkIwvFb5qFYJmi1sm95uvAvkWYimjUA1djg&oe=6AFDB66A"}, {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "1852493309052425", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622202_1852493312385758_2744745263497037285_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TK5cKVhhpNkQ7kNvwEFaAlu&_nc_oc=AdpvlzfSF_0xkAlYQS1p__jVK8iXxQwC-YSvdvClTFHsjQzG8UZ6-ajh6WYoeQc7ANg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjlfzE1ghl37FcKIj-cwhGCd0j6LLKznrLFM153FnF6A&oe=6AFDADC5"}, {"file_name": "game_banner.png", "id": "1620392302874545", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_1620392306207878_5800500059366252969_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nxxw2j9HrvIQ7kNvwGtnpYb&_nc_oc=AdpYxoAp4Bq-u8eI0l5juGoX0RzYcpffGHZ7TmXOPsSUfXJol7ixPR-lOsre-E2qf5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ8EzFGa3Bh5SHdf-QhFtuReEn2qwzqgofzS9y69wy8fg&oe=6AFDC2B6"}, {"file_name": "screen4.png", "id": "3104865936387708", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593767690_3104865939721041_5539181423440315947_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PzD89E87HRIQ7kNvwEp80TD&_nc_oc=AdoDMd317CNF5vDjY2jVelTJuDHFxFKFUNawgsblNuItSgmflz_fOeGdqiGhYnzgW_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTK-iXwZnLcNrD48ELQCaBKQ6TnuDWToOvhQysLIiuLCg&oe=6AFDE0CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "game_banner.png", "id": "1126340246543449", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624592_1126340253210115_9114491889467822369_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=87IeK-OmMaQQ7kNvwG5Wtvk&_nc_oc=Adq-DOPuU_WshEaTd50UEbeKTBgOBDhqnsAADUDkKsi7cEVKJ141P_7Cvbqr6YKDVrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWMtyuu7aTqp_WhG2NXSxNEj_utnyN6zMhOztZcFF2yw&oe=6AFDC124"}, "display_name": "Stardust Racer", "keywords": ["parkour", "dodging", "space", "hoverboard", "racing"], "long_description": "# Stardust Racer \u2014 Release Notes\n**Version:** 1.0.0 (Build 1)  \n**Release Date:** October 2026  \n**Platform:** Meta Quest (Standalone Android)  \n**Package ID:** `com.Stardust.StardustRacer`\n\n---\n\n## What is Stardust Racer?\n\nStardust Racer is a **high-speed, zero-nausea VR endless runner** built for Meta Quest standalone headsets. Players ride a futuristic hoverboard through a procedurally generated cosmic track, dodging obstacles and collecting Stardust coins in an immersive deep-space environment. The game is designed from the ground up for VR comfort \u2014 no locomotion sickness, intuitive controller interactions, and a smooth 72+ FPS target.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfae Features in v1.0.0\n\n### Gameplay\n- Procedurally generated infinite track with three lanes\n- Gradually escalating speed (9.5 m/s \u2192 22 m/s) with dynamic difficulty progression\n- Three obstacle types: **Solid Barriers**, **Low Hurdles** (duck under), **Overhead Arches** (pass through)\n- **Stardust Coin** pickups with glowing golden visuals and spin animation\n- Score and distance tracking with persistent high score via `SaveSystem`\n\n### VR & Controls\n- Full Meta Quest controller support via VR Laser Pointer UI interaction\n- Comfort-first camera: no artificial locomotion, player moves on the track\n- Intuitive VR hand controllers with visual feedback\n- World-space UI panels readable at comfortable VR distances\n\n", "short_description": "Stardust Racer is a high-speed, zero-nausea VR endless runner built for Meta Quest standalone headsets. Players ride a futuristic hoverboard through a procedurally generated cosmic track, dodging obstacles and collecting Stardust coins in an immersive deep-space environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy-policy-for-stardust-racer.vercel.app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sameer Abrar", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://github.com/Flexcrit", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1324514874081851"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1848975803214055"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1666654001749699"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4381077218819845"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1848975803214055"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792506000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1848975803214055"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1337240406142631", "version": "0.1.0"}, "id": "1983929272298167", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1319727094560629", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1337240406142631"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1983929272298167"}]}, "change_log": "\ufffd THE DEEP SPACE & COMFORT UPDATE (v0.2.0)\r\n\u2022 Dynamic Scoreboard: Telemetry HUD now smoothly tracks directly above your board as you switch lanes.\r\n\u2022 Endless Skyline Canyon: Revamped towering skyscraper skyline flanking both sides of the sky-rail.\r\n\u2022 Deep Space Abyss: Cleaned up track environment with soft stardust mist and unobstructed cosmic nebula views.\r\n\u2022 Pause & Confirm System: Dedicated pause menu (Y button) with safety confirmations to protect your high score progress.\r\n\u2022 Performance & Polish: Zeroed garbage collection stutters and smoothed rail transition physics.", "created_date": 1792498260, "id": "1337240406142631", "version": "0.1.0", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1319727094560629", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1337240406142631"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1983929272298167"}]}, "change_log": "# Stardust Racer \u2014 Release Notes\r\n**Version:** 1.0.0 (Build 1)  \r\n**Release Date:** October 2026  \r\n**Platform:** Meta Quest (Standalone Android)  \r\n**Package ID:** `com.Stardust.StardustRacer`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## What is Stardust Racer?\r\n\r\nStardust Racer is a **high-speed, zero-nausea VR endless runner** built for Meta Quest standalone headsets. Players ride a futuristic hoverboard through a procedurally generated cosmic track, dodging obstacles and collecting Stardust coins in an immersive deep-space environment. The game is designed from the ground up for VR comfort \u2014 no locomotion sickness, intuitive controller interactions, and a smooth 72+ FPS target.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ufffd Features in v1.0.0\r\n\r\n### Gameplay\r\n- Procedurally generated infinite track with three lanes\r\n- Gradually escalating speed (9.5 m/s \u2192 22 m/s) with dynamic difficulty progression\r\n- Three obstacle types: **Solid Barriers**, **Low Hurdles** (duck under), **Overhead Arches** (pass through)\r\n- **Stardust Coin** pickups with glowing golden visuals and spin animation\r\n- Score and distance tracking with persistent high score via `SaveSystem`\r\n\r\n### VR & Controls\r\n- Full Meta Quest controller support via VR Laser Pointer UI interaction\r\n- Comfort-first camera: no artificial locomotion, player moves on the track\r\n- Intuitive VR hand controllers with visual feedback\r\n- World-space UI panels readable at comfortable VR distances\r\n\r\n### Visuals\r\n- Deep Space Skybox Pack background (DiverseSpace material)\r\n- Neon-lit pearl rail track with cyan glow guides and cross-beam ties\r\n- Cybernetic hex-grid energy barrier visuals\r\n- Custom golden Stardust coin texture with star highlight\r\n- Cinematic VR splash screen with Stardust Racer branding\r\n\r\n### Audio\r\n- Procedural audio manager (`ProceduralAudioManager`) for dynamic spatial sound\r\n- Obstacle and pickup sound cues\r\n\r\n### Menus & UI\r\n- Main Menu, Pause Menu, Game Over screen \u2014 all in World Space VR\r\n- Customize screen\r\n- Tutorial overlay for new players (`TutorialController`)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ufffd Technical Specifications\r\n\r\n| Property | Value |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Engine | Unity 6000.3.24f1 |\r\n| Render Pipeline | Universal Render Pipeline (URP) 17.3.0 |\r\n| Meta XR SDK | `com.meta.xr.sdk.all` v207.0.0 |\r\n| XR Plugin | OpenXR 1.16.1 |\r\n| Input System | Unity Input System 1.20.0 |\r\n| TextMeshPro | via `com.unity.ugui` 2.0.0 |\r\n| Target Platform | Android (Meta Quest) |\r\n| Bundle Version | 0.1.0 |\r\n| Bundle Version Code | 1 |\r\n| Min Android API | 29 (Android 10) |\r\n| Architecture | ARM64 |\r\n| Texture Compression | ASTC |\r\n| Scripting Backend | IL2CPP |\r\n\r\n### Codebase\r\n17 runtime scripts across 6 modules:\r\n\r\n| Module | Scripts |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| **Core** | `GameManager`, `SaveSystem` |\r\n| **Player** | `HoverboardController`, `PlayerCollisionHandler`, `CourierAvatar` |\r\n| **Track** | `TrackManager`, `TrackSegment`, `ObstacleSpawner`, `ObstacleHazard`, `StardustPickup` |\r\n| **Input** | `VRInputManager`, `VRHandController`, `VRLaserPointer`, `VRCameraFollow` |\r\n| **UI** | `VRUIManager` |\r\n| **Audio** | `ProceduralAudioManager` |\r\n| **Tutorial** | `TutorialController` |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ufffd Meta Quest Store Submission Requirements\r\n\r\n### Required Assets (to prepare)\r\n| Asset | Status | Spec |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| App Icon (512\u00d7512) | \ufffd Generated | `Assets/Textures/stardust_racer_app_icon.jpg` |\r\n| VR Splash Screen | \ufffd Configured | `Assets/Textures/Splash_StardustRacer_VR.png` |\r\n| Logo | \ufffd Generated | `Assets/Textures/Splash_StardustRacer_Logo.png` |\r\n| Hero Banner (1920\u00d71080) | \ufffd Needed | Cinematic key art |\r\n| Screenshots (min 3) | \ufffd Needed | 2560\u00d71440, captured from Quest |\r\n| Short Description (80 chars) | \ufffd Needed | Store listing copy |\r\n| Long Description (4000 chars) | \ufffd Needed | Full store listing copy |\r\n| Age Rating | \ufffd Needed | Complete IARC questionnaire at submission |\r\n\r\n### Required Technical Steps Before Submission\r\n- [ ] Configure **Keystore** in Unity: *Edit \u2192 Project Settings \u2192 Player \u2192 Android \u2192 Publishing Settings*\r\n- [ ] Set **Target API Level** to Android 12L (API 32) or higher in Player Settings\r\n- [ ] Set **Scripting Backend** to IL2CPP and **Architecture** to ARM64 only\r\n- [ ] Set **Texture Compression** to ASTC\r\n- [ ] Verify **XR Plug-in Management** has Oculus checked under Android\r\n- [ ] Build signed APK: *Stardust Racer \u2192 Build Quest Standalone APK*\r\n- [ ] Test APK on physical Quest device via `adb install`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ufffd Known Issues / Limitations in v1.0.0\r\n\r\n- Pause/menu overlay relies on world-space UI \u2014 may need adjustment if headset tracking is lost\r\n- Stardust coin texture is procedurally generated at build time; re-run **Build Complete Game Scene** if texture appears corrupted\r\n- No cloud save \u2014 high score is stored locally on device only\r\n- No haptic feedback on controller interactions (planned for v1.1)\r\n- Audio is procedural only \u2014 no licensed music tracks\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## \ufffd Roadmap (Post-Launch)\r\n\r\n| Version | Planned |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| **v1.1** | Controller haptics, leaderboard (Meta Platform SDK), new obstacle types |\r\n| **v1.2** | Power-ups, speed boost pickups, shield mechanic |\r\n| **v1.3** | Additional skybox environments, unlockable hoverboard skins |\r\n| **v2.0** | Multiplayer ghost racing (async) |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Build Instructions\r\n\r\n```\r\n1. Open project in Unity 6000.3.24f1\r\n2. Switch platform: Stardust Racer \u2192 Switch Active Platform to Android\r\n3. Run: Stardust Racer \u2192 Build Complete Game Scene & Assets\r\n4. Configure keystore in Player Settings \u2192 Publishing Settings\r\n5. Run: Stardust Racer \u2192 Build Quest Standalone APK\r\n6. Output: Builds/StardustRacer.apk\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Stardust Racer \u00a9 2026. Built with Unity 6 and Meta XR SDK.*", "created_date": 1791656402, "id": "1321095567757115", "version": "0.1.0", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}